# Guestbook signup sheet prompt for Claude

Paste this into browser Claude (claude.ai), alongside the attached `guestbook/repomix.xml` (the whole context packed in one XML file, 22 files, ~57,000 tokens). It follows the model-routing framework's Claude greenfield template: multishot examples + XML structure + self-correction chaining + named banned patterns, one verb, explicit boundary and stop condition. Routing: greenfield generation, Claude Opus 5.5 `high`.

Creative direction (revised 2026-11-09): entropic and 3D. The sheet is driven by entropy (seeded randomness, stochastic variation, unique every time) and by 3D motion (camera dolly, depth, lanes moving in 3D space). GLITTERBOX is NOT the signing gesture and is NOT an asset pool here.

